<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	11.675/11.475 11.95 /11.85   12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>Citibank		 11.525/11.425 11.80 /11.70   12.15 /12.05</p>
<p>Metrobank		11.55/11.45   12.0 /11.725   12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>PNB			11.7 /11.40   11.80 /11.60   12.25 /12.0</p>
<p>Security Bank	  11.7/11.45    11.9/11.7	12.3/12.1</p>
<p>StanChart		11.5 /11.375  11.825/11.725  12.20 /12.10</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
